doing in my institution.

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:15.460
It could be as quick as one or two years.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.980
It could take way longer.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:21.210
It really all depends
on the funding that we

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:24.720
will be able to secure and then of course

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:27.250
the reach that we can get through you

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:29.088
and in general our institution.

00:12:29.088 --> 00:12:29.921
- And you.

00:12:29.921 --> 00:12:31.010
- And you guys.

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:34.100
- So people wanna learn more
about the AuryzoN device,

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:36.480
they wanna maybe even donate and help you

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.920
